        <mxCell id="v2" value="Precondition: an escalation case is OPEN (sequence c, transition C01) and assigned to a moderator of the transaction's community. Case transitions C02&amp;#8211;C04: escalation-case state machine. Endpoints are proposals for the DA-10 REST table. The Notifier (ADR-0013) and the Scheduler (ADR-0012) are iteration 2 components owned by Areeba and Fatima." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#4A5560;spacing=2;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1">
